Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们忍者的技艺绝不外传
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,决不能让外面的人学会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的生命 承担的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是为了这日本的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次的恐怖活动彻底颠覆世界的格局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,从今往后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开日本的统治
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,开始接受大国的管理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我们也开始将忍者的技艺传给外人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为了今后的日本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,违背此次决定的人 叛离的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,将被视作叛忍被组织解决
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看你现在有多惨 彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是这些家伙太吵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,本来以为到死都不会再见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠的事 真是不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不把面容藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,组织好像发现了识破伪装系统的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我取掉吧 已经没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 每次见你 你都是一身伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是医生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你用了极限感知的秘术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,以后再也别用了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别说下一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这么重的伤还能不死吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么没有死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是你天生的运气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要不就是有人留了你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,准备开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,想要开始正常活动 就算你也得花个五六天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,能稍微活动 我就可以去问那家伙问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,之后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,闯进据点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,自己一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能帮我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不会痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,除了一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就这点小折磨 忍者可不会开口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么目的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那女人的眼神真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩眼中只有恐惧 很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那女人的眼中 最后都充满了愤怒与厌恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,然后每当我用剑刺她一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用眼睛 用大脑好好记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的地狱现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听皮肤破裂骨骼粉碎的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听这连脊髓都被抽尽的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,将你的肠子掏出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕心脏停止也不会解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,死后仍受尽鬼的折磨 恐惧颤抖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没法调查是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了那种事 怎么能装不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别翻来覆去了好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不知道那是谁的血
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有监控摄像头的录像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还能怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,总之这是上面给的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再追查这件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是越来越窝囊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上就退休了 我不想开除你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老老实实调查其他案件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那艾玛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她可是看到乔·洛根和那群人战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你再去问问她？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,上面说什么就是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,反抗也没有意义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那还不如聪明点 表面服从
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,表面服从？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,上面直接这样给压力 有点好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这案件绝对有隐情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们慢慢调查好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,从医院消失的乔·洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我照你所说 调查了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,被杀害的妻子莎拉·洛根 儿子凯尔·洛根 都用的假名
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,和至今为止的受害人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈的猜测没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,到底在发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,终于完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能保护同伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也能保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,管好你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有点少了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不能再…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,外面的摩托车是你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最近附近经常有摩托车被偷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是偷来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,驾照拿出来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别装模作样…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你是真的在玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说有犯人{\fsp8}在{\r}V{\fsp8}R{\r}世界进行交易
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看过资料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得赶快把这边的问题解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就没时间调查洛根的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真搞不懂什么假想空间哪里厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是外星人的科技
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这几{\fsp8}年{\r}V{\fsp8}R{\r}的进步特别大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,全是多亏{\fsp8}了{\r}AUZA
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克·莫里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是乔·洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在叫乔·洛根的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有问题要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么 我们不是正在聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我闹着玩 没有下次了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你有点紧张呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别 别挂电话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 别挂电话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我个地点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我来选地点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那这样 圣马克有一家叫龙虎房的中华餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天傍晚过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「从摇篮到坟墓」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这用来形容过去某个国家的社会福利制度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然而现如今 这句话用来说我{\fsp8}们{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}最为合适
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,从摇篮到坟墓 AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的科技将从各个方面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,辅助你 辅助你的家人还有朋友 所有人的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这里什么时候都没客人 正好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么呢 蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你能走开一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可是我的店 别命令店长好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都跟你说了让你避开高峰期
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,高峰是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要是送外卖的来了 让他们看清楚再拿桌上的外卖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么还没用上无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这里又不{\fsp8}是{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}城
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,弄坏的东西我要让你赔的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,3{\fsp8}0{\r}分钟以后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我还担心你是不是死在哪个路边了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,确认一下是不是本人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这能证明什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还真拿不准你会不会来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你不怕自己被抓捕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间跟你闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你想问什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这一系列的案件
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你有犯人的线索吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,多么细节的东西都行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会回答我的问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要问了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我看起来像会跟嫌疑犯做交易的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会轻易放你走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跪下 双手抱在头后面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,回答我 医院里发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}外卖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,饺子 干烧虾仁 麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,确认没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不逃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为话还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就等你跟我回局里好好说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}外卖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,炒饭 春卷 回锅肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别想做多余的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在就要逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就在桌子上面 确认完赶快拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,北京烤鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,医院里的男人去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是 忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙还有在医院袭击我的家伙们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你说忍者？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我也就是听说过…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说之前的凶杀案…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,陶瓷板都切坏了 刀刃还和新的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这究竟是谁制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能是外星人的科技吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZA
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从摇篮到坟墓 AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的科技将从各个方面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:21:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,辅助你 辅助你的家人还有朋友 所有人的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是「在」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙依旧活着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Comment: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,IN
Comment: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:45.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:55.75,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:38.63,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:43.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:45.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:55.75,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:38.63,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:43.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
